README file is for the Virtuoso ADE Explorer and Assembler S1: ADE Explorer and Single Test Corner Analysis using IC 25.1 and SPECTRE 24.1 This software will only run on Red Hat Linux 8.4 and above.
  
Course Developer: 

Michael Arul Abel J 
Cadence Design Systems

Course Editor:
Karishma Chaudhary
Cadence Design Systems

Software Required: 

The VAEAS1: ADE Explorer and Single Test Corner Analysis Course requires the install of: 
    IC 25.1
    SPECTRE 24.1
    
Licenses:
    VSE L, XL
    Virtuoso ADE Explorer + tokens
    ViVA 
    SPECTRE + tokens 

Course install:

Copy and untar the VAEAS1_IC_25_1.tar.gz (or.Z) database to the login directory (user30 or whatever).
In a Cadence classroom, you should automatically be changed to the VAEAS1
directory upon login. 

Environment setup:

A .class_setup file should automatically source the software in a Cadence onsite classroom.

For offsite classes, the VAEAS1 directory contains a cshrc file which
contains the variables:
CDSHOME pointing to the install directory for IC 25.1, and 
SPECTREHOME which points to the install directory for SPECTRE 241
 
These paths will need to be modified
for the installed software, and added to the login .cshrc file,
or sourced before starting lab.

source cshrc

